## Project 1: Basic Circuit

### Introduction
  The purpose of this projectis to learn how to build simplecircuits by using the Raspberry PICO board, power supplies and simplpe electronic components to test an idea created from a model.

### Materials List
- Breadboard
- Raspberry PICO board
- Power module and LiPo battery in the holder or USB cable
- Red LED
- resistor 220 Ohm
- resistor 10 kOhm
- resistor 100 kOhm
- tactile switch
- 4 x 10 mF electrolytic capacitors
- Wires

